{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>ניר ראשים</b> — It is possible that it is a verbal noun from נירו לכם ניר, like רב אוכל יהי לראשים, at the time they sow and work the land, as in: עובד אדמתו ישבע לחם." "<b>ואיש נספה</b> — because he does not know justice — plowing and sowing, like ויסרו למשפט, which speaks about the matter of sowing."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:46.097577326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}